claude-usage-pacer — https://github.com/One-Lyf/claude-usage-pacer
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Used as a reference (commit 09fdc86). The pacing in src/shared/usage/pace.ts is
adapted from usage.py: the target line cap × elapsed ÷ window length for the
5-hour and 7-day windows (default cap 90%), the Behind / On pace / Ahead
status with a ±5 point tolerance, "room left per hour", and advice that treats
the weekly window as the binding limit. The app does not read Claude's OAuth
token or call the usage endpoint usage-pacer relies on; it paces the
percentages from the status line bridge.

